<title>UK: London gold fixes firmer, steadying around $380.00.</title>
<headline>London gold fixes firmer, steadying around $380.00.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Fixed at $380.20 vs $378.85 previously. Light two-way business. Seen settling in around $380.00 but defensive and prone to sharp move either way.</p>
<p>SILVER - Steady so far at $4.90/$4.92 unchanged. Likely to follow gold. Stuck in $4.85-$4.95 range meantime.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Just firmer at $383.75/$384.75 vs $382.70/$383.70.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Up $1.00 at $120.25/$121.25.</p>
</text>
